+    /// independent: `last_any_valid_rx_at` stays fresh from the `Message` traffic alone, while
+    /// `last_temperature_sample_at` (seeded once during baseline) goes stale on its own separate
+    /// clock.
+    fn spawn_device_with_message_traffic_but_no_active_phase_temperature(
